# Written by the /device push route every time a patch goes to the hardware:
# a full copy of the 1MB volume, so each one holds a config.json and any wavs.
# Session artifacts and user audio, not source.
device-backup-*/
config.device-backup-*.json

# the staging file the push used before it carried samples itself
config.staged.json

# Working notes for the build: design decisions with their reasoning, and the
# traps already hit. Kept locally because it is the most useful file here, but
# it quotes conversations verbatim, which is nobody else's business.
CLAUDE.md
